  "itemid": "1306765",
  "languages": {
    "english": {
      "app[content][about]": "[p]Move each falling Tron into place and complete a line. When a line clears, the Trons above it fall and open a new decision. Keep clearing without breaking the flow to build your CON and push your score higher.[/p][p]AVALANCHE adds falling snow and special Trons to the familiar rhythm of a falling-block puzzle. Snow changes the shape of the field, while metal Trons can crush it and create a new route through the stack. Planning the next placement matters as much as reacting to the piece in front of you.[/p][p]Play for as long as you can, chase a personal best, and refine the way you build. Track your score, cleared lines, highest CON, and Tron clears as you learn the board one run at a time.[/p][p]Features[/p][p]- Clear lines without breaking your CON and turn each placement into a higher score[/p][p]- Seven regular Trons, plus a special metal Tron that crushes snow and opens new routes[/p][p]- As the level rises, falling speed and snowfall leave less room for mistakes[/p][p]- Plan one placement ahead with Hold, Ghost, and NEXT preview[/p][p]- Keyboard and controller support, from quick runs to personal-best attempts[/p][p]- Japanese, English, Simplified Chinese, and Korean UI, with achievements and personal bests[/p]",
      "app[content][short_description]": "Stack Trons through a snowfall, clear lines, and keep your CON alive in a focused falling-block score attack. Use special Trons to open routes through the field, then plan ahead as the pace picks up. From quick runs to personal-best attempts.",
      "app[content][sysreqs][windows][min][osversion]": "Windows 10 (64-bit)",
